  (text "HX-6: 6x BM1370 Bitcoin miner. 12 V in (XT60, 15 A fuse). Core: TPS53647 4-phase + CSD95490Q5MC, ~0.9-1.35 V, up to ~120 A. Chain: U-shaped, 1.2 V UART via TXU0304. Controller: ESP32-S3-WROOM-1-N16R8. I2C (IO8/IO9): TPS53647 0x71, EMC2302-1 0x2E, TMP1075 0x48/0x49/0x4A, touch FT6336U 0x38."
